<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>High‑density bubble wrap</strong> – Wrapped tightly around each component, the bubble wrap’s 30 mm air‑filled cells provide a cushioning barrier that absorbs impact forces, preventing surface scratches and breakage during loading and unloading.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Foam edge protectors</strong> – Custom‑cut polyurethane foam strips are placed on corners and edges, dispersing point loads and shielding vulnerable angles from compression and puncture when pallets are stacked.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Multi‑ply corrugated sheets</strong> – Three‑layer kraft corrugated panels are interleaved between items, creating a rigid sandwich that resists bending, distributes weight evenly, and adds an extra barrier against dust and humidity.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Stretch film</strong> – A high‑tensile, puncture‑resistant stretch film tightly encases the assembled bundle, securing all previous layers, reducing movement, and providing a moisture‑proof seal that protects against rain or spills.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Custom wooden crates</strong> – Precision‑engineered crates with reinforced corners and internal bracing act as a sturdy outer shell, absorbing macro‑shocks from road vibrations and safeguarding the inner packaging from external impacts.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Anti‑static liners</strong> – Thin, conductive liners line the interior of the wooden crate, dissipating static electricity that could damage sensitive electronic components during transit.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Temperature‑controlled insulated blankets</strong> – Placed over the crate, these blankets maintain a stable thermal environment, preventing condensation and temperature fluctuations that could compromise delicate parts.</span></li>
</ul>
<p>By integrating these seven complementary layers, the packaging system delivers comprehensive protection, ensuring that fragile items arrive in Bangalore intact, operational, and ready for immediate deployment.</p></div>
