        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: visit our website, click the &quot;Get Instant Shifting Estimate&quot; button, and fill in pickup and delivery details, inventory list, and preferred moving date. Our system generates a quote within minutes. Confirm the quote, choose your payment option, and our dedicated team schedules the pickup. You’ll receive a confirmation email with the driver’s contact and tracking link.</p>
