      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move from Hydrabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a load from Hydrabad to Bangalore, you need a valid government‑issued ID (Aadhaar, PAN, or passport), proof of address at both origin and destination, and the GST‑registered invoice of the moving company. If the move is for corporate reimbursement, provide the official transfer order and any bank‑approved claim forms. All documents are verified before loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the cargo insured during the transit from Hydrabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage throughout the journey on our GPS‑tracked container trucks. You receive an insurance certificate at the time of booking, and any claim is processed within 48 hours of delivery with full documentation support.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a household load from Hydrabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door transit time on the NH‑44/33 corridor is 18‑22 hours, depending on traffic, weather, and checkpoint clearances. Our real‑time tracking system provides live updates, and we plan routes to avoid peak congestion. For urgent moves, we offer an express service that can reduce transit time by up to 4 hours.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of moving from Hydrabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Cost is determined by four main factors: the total distance (≈850 km), the type and size of the container truck required, the volume and weight of your goods, and any additional services such as premium packing, insurance upgrades, or temporary storage in Bangalore. Our transparent cost matrix breaks down each component so you know exactly what you’re paying for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I store my belongings in Bangalore if I need a temporary holding area?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. We operate a 24/7 CCTV‑monitored warehousing facility in Bangalore with climate‑controlled sections for sensitive items. Short‑term (up to 30 days) and long‑term storage options are available, each with a per‑cubic‑foot rate. All stored goods are covered by the same 100% insurance policy, and you can access them anytime with a secure passcode.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does IBA approval mean for my move from Hydrabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA (Indian Banks Association) approval indicates that our mover code complies with the banking sector’s standards for transparency, financial security, and dispute resolution. It assures you that payments are protected, contracts are clear, and any grievances are addressed through a recognized grievance redressal mechanism, giving you added confidence in the relocation process.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
